 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cook the rice in the water — rice cooker or pot (see <a href=\"onigiri.html\">onigiri</a>). <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1½ cups</span> of uncooked rice makes about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"660\" data-s=\"0\">660 g</span> cooked: 12 onigiri.</li><li>While it cooks, fry the shrimp (steps 2–7).</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cook the rice",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [],
    "illustration": "illustrations/shrimp-karaage-onigiri/1.webp?v=95d5873dcd",
    "photo": null,
    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 1,
   "part": "Rice",
   "part_id": "part-rice",
   "time": "~45 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~45 min</span>",
   "title": "Cook the rice",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ cups</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"300\" data-alt=\"1\">300 g</span>)</span>",
     "name_html": "Japanese short-grain white rice"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1.6667\">1⅔ cups</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"400\" data-alt=\"1\">400 ml</span>)</span>",
     "name_html": "Water (for the rice)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Peel the shells <b>and the tails</b> — nothing sticks out of the finished onigiri.</li><li>Run a skewer under the dark vein along the back and lift it out.</li><li>Bend each shrimp into a tight C so it sits in a small rice ball.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
