   "time_html": "<span>20–30 min</span>",
   "title": "Marinate",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Spread the tapioca starch on a cutting board.</li><li>Drizzle <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">1–2 tsp</span> water over part of it and work with a fork into small crumbs and pebbles — same trick as <a href=\"karaage.html\">karaage</a>.</li></ul>",
