     "amount_html": "enough for <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"3\" data-b=\"4\" data-s=\"0\">3–4 cm</span> depth",
     "name_html": "Neutral oil (for deep-frying)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lift the shrimp from the marinade; shake off excess. Roll each in the starch and crumbs, pressing so the bits stick.</li><li>First fry: a few at a time, about 1½–2 minutes, until <b>pale gold</b>. Rest on a rack 2–3 minutes.</li><li>Second fry: back in until <b>deeper golden and crisp</b>, about 30–45 seconds. Drain.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
