  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Turn the hot rice into a large bowl to cool a little: <b>warm</b>, cool enough to hold.</li><li>Set out a small bowl of water and a little salt. Wet your hands and rub a pinch of salt over your palms.</li></ul>",
