  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Scoop about one rice paddle (~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"55\" data-s=\"0\">55 g</span>) into your left palm.</li><li>Press a small well in the middle. Lay one curled shrimp in it and add about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-s=\"0\">½ tsp</span> spicy mayo.</li><li>Close the rice over it with one gentle squeeze — like a snowball. Nothing should poke out.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
